# Component Organization

Components are organized in [src/components](mdc:src/components) directory:

- [src/components/ui](mdc:src/components/ui) - Common UI elements and primitive components
- [src/components/forms](mdc:src/components/forms) - Form components and input elements
- [src/components/exercises](mdc:src/components/exercises) - Exercise-specific components
- [src/components/dashboard](mdc:src/components/dashboard) - Dashboard components
- [src/components/calendar](mdc:src/components/calendar) - Calendar related components

Each component should be in its own directory when it has associated sub-components or styles.
